{
  "file_id": "3575",
  "text_count": 241,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "If we keep this up, we'll be able\nto defeat the Dark Masters!",
      "_offset": 4465,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "And peace will return to Earth!",
      "_offset": 4527,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Okay, let's go!",
      "_offset": 4559,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "I've had enough!",
      "_offset": 4575,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Huh? What did you say?",
      "_offset": 4592,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "I've had enough of this. Why do we\nhave to keep fighting?!",
      "_offset": 4615,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "What...?",
      "_offset": 4674,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "Tai, at least consider other\npeople's feelings for a bit!",
      "_offset": 4683,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "And what do you mean by that?",
      "_offset": 4744,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "You're right about what you just\nsaid.",
      "_offset": 4774,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "But you know, just because you're\nright doesn't mean you can just\npush aside people's feelings!",
      "_offset": 4817,
      "_length": 95,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Matt...",
      "_offset": 4913,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "I know the only thing we can do is\nto keep pushing forward...",
      "_offset": 4923,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Don't you ever want to stop and\nconsider everything that's gong on\nonce in a while?!",
      "_offset": 4985,
      "_length": 84,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "But we can't save the world this way",
      "_offset": 5070,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "I understand how Mimi feels, too",
      "_offset": 5107,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "We don't have time to sit around!",
      "_offset": 5140,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "I *know* that!",
      "_offset": 5174,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "Do you really?",
      "_offset": 5189,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "Tai!",
      "_offset": 5204,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Please, stop. Everyone's upset.",
      "_offset": 5212,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "We stand out too much as it is, so\nlet's move somewhere safer.",
      "_offset": 5244,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "(Was I wrong...?)",
      "_offset": 5307,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "(Why won't Matt believe me...?)",
      "_offset": 5325,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "(It's not like I'm wrong! Why\ndoesn't he get that?)",
      "_offset": 5359,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "(Soon we won't even have time to\nrest, huh...)",
      "_offset": 5411,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "(What happened to Matt...?)",
      "_offset": 5458,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "(At this rate, nobody's going to\nbe able to agree with each other\nanymore...)",
      "_offset": 5488,
      "_length": 77,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "(We have to find someplace to\nrest...)",
      "_offset": 5566,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "(Everyone's tired...)",
      "_offset": 5605,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "Hey! Why don't we take a break for\na bit?",
      "_offset": 5627,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "I agree!",
      "_offset": 5669,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Yeah...",
      "_offset": 5678,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "I should talk to everyone for a bit",
      "_offset": 5686,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "We should get going and leave...",
      "_offset": 5722,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "We have to stop Mimi from saying\ntoo much, before she gets all of\nus to start fighting.",
      "_offset": 5755,
      "_length": 87,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Right now we're in a bad\nsituation, so everyone's feeling\ndown.",
      "_offset": 5843,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Sorry, Tai. If we'd only been\nstronger...",
      "_offset": 5907,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "You're already doing enough,\nAgumon. Now we just have to work\ntogether and survive.",
      "_offset": 5952,
      "_length": 83,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "That's all we can do. I *know*.",
      "_offset": 6036,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Really?",
      "_offset": 6068,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Looks like there aren't any\nenemies around here... I'd like it\nto stay that way, but...",
      "_offset": 6076,
      "_length": 87,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Sorry for making you worry,\nSora...",
      "_offset": 6164,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Everyone is anxious... It would be\nbetter for us to know where the\nenemy will move next, but...",
      "_offset": 6200,
      "_length": 95,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Yeah. But you should rest for now,\nIzzy.",
      "_offset": 6296,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "Ever since we came back to the\nDigimon world, someone's always\nbeen getting hurt...",
      "_offset": 6342,
      "_length": 83,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "But we have to keep fighting, or\nelse both worlds will be in\ndanger...",
      "_offset": 6426,
      "_length": 70,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "I know, but... I can't fight\nanymore.",
      "_offset": 6497,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Sorry, Tai... I've been saying\nall these selfish things...",
      "_offset": 6535,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "Mimi...",
      "_offset": 6597,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Why does Matt keep getting into\nfights with Tai...?",
      "_offset": 6605,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "T.K...",
      "_offset": 6662,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "The Dark Masters are all\nUltimates. The fight's only gonna\nget harder...",
      "_offset": 6672,
      "_length": 72,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "Can't you evolve to Ultimate,\nGomamon?",
      "_offset": 6745,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "If you keep pushing me like that,\nit's only gonna get harder for me!",
      "_offset": 6784,
      "_length": 68,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "Yeah, you're right...",
      "_offset": 6853,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "I think everyone's tired because\nthey've been fighting for so long.",
      "_offset": 6875,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "Yeah, everyone seems to have\ngotten tired of all the fighting.",
      "_offset": 6943,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "Let's do our best to not add onto\neveryone's burdens.",
      "_offset": 7006,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "Yeah, what Tailmon said.",
      "_offset": 7060,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "I'm glad you're working hard, but\ndon't push yourself too much.",
      "_offset": 7085,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "It'll be fine! I'm your sister,\nafter all.",
      "_offset": 7149,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "Guys! Let's hurry and get out of\nhere!",
      "_offset": 7192,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "Tai, don't go deciding things\non your own. Can't you tell\neveryone's tired?",
      "_offset": 7231,
      "_length": 78,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "Stop trying to be difficult all\nthe time!",
      "_offset": 7310,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "What?!",
      "_offset": 7352,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "Matt, don't fight with him...",
      "_offset": 7359,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "T.K...",
      "_offset": 7391,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "At this rate, they'll get us! Our\nenemies will be able to track us\ndown!",
      "_offset": 7401,
      "_length": 72,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "Now you just wait!",
      "_offset": 7474,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "?! Tai... disappeared?",
      "_offset": 7493,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "Where'd he go?",
      "_offset": 7519,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "Mimi's gone, too!",
      "_offset": 7534,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "Where are you, Mimi?",
      "_offset": 7552,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "Sora?!",
      "_offset": 7573,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "Izzy's up and vanished, too!",
      "_offset": 7580,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "Joe?!",
      "_offset": 7614,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "Kari?!",
      "_offset": 7620,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "Everyone's gone...",
      "_offset": 7629,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "T.K... I'll make sure to\nprotect you, and only you!",
      "_offset": 7648,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "Hey, Matt... How come you're\nalways giving me special\ntreatment?",
      "_offset": 7703,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "T.K?!",
      "_offset": 7770,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "I came here so I could fight with\nyou. Am I really that unreliable?",
      "_offset": 7779,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "T.K... that's not what I\nmeant... I... what I wanted to say\nwas...",
      "_offset": 7847,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "What?",
      "_offset": 7917,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "W...What?!",
      "_offset": 7927,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "Huh?!",
      "_offset": 7938,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "What just happened?",
      "_offset": 7944,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "This must be... the work of the\nenemy...",
      "_offset": 7964,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "Aaaaah! What's going on?!",
      "_offset": 8005,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "Huh? Where's Tailmon?!",
      "_offset": 8031,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "Aaaaaaaagh!",
      "_offset": 8054,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "Tai!",
      "_offset": 8066,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "Where'd everyone go?",
      "_offset": 8074,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "Sitting around like this isn't\ngoing to get us anywhere. Let's go\nlook for them!",
      "_offset": 8095,
      "_length": 80,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "Got it! I'll go look for T.K!",
      "_offset": 8176,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "I'll... wait here...",
      "_offset": 8209,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "Izzy, wait here with Mimi!",
      "_offset": 8230,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "Understood! I'll leave the rest to\nyou all!",
      "_offset": 8262,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "T.K, are you okay?! You're not\nhurt anywhere, are you?",
      "_offset": 8306,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "Hey, can you stop fussing so much\nover me?",
      "_offset": 8364,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "I can take care of myself, you\nknow!",
      "_offset": 8407,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "T.K...",
      "_offset": 8444,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "Let's plaaaaay!",
      "_offset": 8454,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "Who's...",
      "_offset": 8470,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "Let's plaaaaay!",
      "_offset": 8479,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "That voice is getting closer!",
      "_offset": 8495,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "english": "Let's play!",
      "_offset": 8525,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "english": "You're...!",
      "_offset": 8537,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "english": "If you lay even one finger on\nT.K, I'll make you regret it!",
      "_offset": 8548,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "english": "Hmph, so your name's T.K? Hey,\ndo you wanna play war with me?",
      "_offset": 8611,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "english": "T.K! Don't listen to him!",
      "_offset": 8676,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "english": "I don't care about you!",
      "_offset": 8705,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "english": "Ugh...!",
      "_offset": 8729,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "english": "Matt!",
      "_offset": 8737,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "english": "Okay, let's go.",
      "_offset": 8745,
      "_length": 15,
